  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 73ff519377b990a4c81cd1461a3c1f62, type: 3}
  m_Name: LolaNida_W57_Teach
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueNode
  speakerName: Lola Nida
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueText: 'No mangibaga wenno mangiladawan ka iti espesipiko a banag, mabalin
    nga agusar ti Ilokano iti ''isu ti'' a paset ti istruktura ti pangungusap.


    Kas
    pagarigan, makatulong daytoy a mangipakita iti kapanunotan a kas iti ''is the''
    iti English.


    Denggem a naimbag: isu ti.


    Ita, padasem nga ibagam ti
    ''isu ti'' iti bukodmo a timek.'
  translatedText: 'When identifying or describing something specific, Ilokano can
    use ''isu ti'' as part of the sentence structure.

    For example, it can help
    express an idea similar to ''is the'' in English.

    Now, try saying ''isu
    ti'' yourself.'
